7. Developer Manual
7.1 Development Environment Setup
7.1.1 Prerequisites
-Node.js (v14 or higher) and npm

-PostgreSQL database server

-Git for version control

-Code editor -VS Code

-Abstract IP Geolocation API key
7.1.2 Installation Steps
-Clone the repository: git clone https://github.com/AryaPatel36/Student-Tracker-App.git

-Navigate to project directory: cd StudentTrackerApp

-Install dependencies: npm install

-Create database: student_tracker

-Run schema script: mysql -u username -p student_tracker < database/schema.sql

-Create .env file with:
    DB_HOST=localhost
    DB_USER=your_db_user
    DB_PASSWORD=your_db_password
    DB_NAME=student_tracker
    GEOLOCATION_API_KEY=your_api_key
    SESSION_SECRET=your_secret
    PORT=3000

-Start application: npm run dev
